No, that isn't possible. He must be mistaken about not being satiated
before.

Note that even if you get interrupted while eating, you can always finish
what you started if you weren't satiated *when* you started, provided you
didn't snack anything in between.

So you can't start eating a dragon corpse, get interrupted, eat a fortune
cookie, and then continue on your dragon corpse.

